🎵 Spotify Clone
📌 Introduction

A responsive Spotify Web Player Clone built using HTML5 and CSS3. This project recreates the modern Spotify user interface with a focus on clean design, responsive layout, and smooth user experience. It was developed to strengthen front-end development skills by implementing real-world UI components using only HTML and CSS.

📖 About

This project is a static clone of the Spotify Web Player designed to closely resemble the original interface. It includes a fully structured sidebar, navigation bar, music cards, and a custom-designed music player with interactive hover effects inspired by Spotify.

The project demonstrates the use of modern CSS techniques such as Flexbox, responsive layouts, custom range sliders, hover animations, and reusable UI components while maintaining a clean and organized code structure.

✨ Features
🎵 Spotify-inspired modern UI
📱 Responsive layout
🎧 Bottom music player
🎚️ Interactive progress bar
🔊 Spotify-style volume slider
🖼️ Album artwork section
📚 Sidebar with Library
🔍 Search & Home navigation
🎼 Music cards with hover effects
💎 Premium & Install App buttons
⚡ Built using pure HTML & CSS


🛠️ Technologies Used
HTML5
CSS3
Flexbox
Font Awesome
Google Fonts (Montserrat)


